{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0222_1000_p", "source_sha256": "456838a893cea87c8927ac23d2602812fcb69efd0df9c7b9f211f7e3bebe59ee", "ja": "（溜まっていた事務仕事が、ようやく一段落した。\n少し休憩するか……ん？）", "zh": "（堆积的事务工作终于告一段落了。\n要稍微休息一下吗……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0222_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "d90e8f498a2ce008e2a84b112c3ca6e3900c552f559e81ec592e34fc59bcade3", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\n今からみんなで休憩なんですけど、一緒にどうですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我们现在要一起休息一下，你要不要也来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0222_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6d2660a01602a80cb7f35c1d5664d2c0d29c6f9abb56e8be7dde4e3766134ee9", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう。それじゃ、少しだけ……ん？\nこのアイスは、もしかして……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢。那就稍微休息一下……嗯？\n这个冰淇淋，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0222_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "3f7aa37487922d5648fb507c998fbc994c5061e846f1916e9729dda7129535fd", "ja": "はい！　この前、アイスクリームの撮影の時に\nもらったアイスが、まだ残ってたので。", "zh": "是的！之前拍摄冰淇淋广告时拿到的冰淇淋，还剩了一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0222_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "ce2b76fcfbc397461f86b9addb3aa4fd38757726f0b693826a1d4b65644e1dd9", "ja": "抹茶アイスって、おいしいですよね！　ほろ苦くて、\nすこしだけ甘くて……大人の味って感じがします。", "zh": "抹茶冰淇淋很好吃，对吧！带着微苦的味道，又有一点点甜……感觉就是大人的味道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0222_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1ac5ebb589b347d4e98398984b22ed39295231c61fe2c0dd1a60687f96839867", "ja": "大人の味か。確かに、この前の抹茶アイス風の衣装は、\n百合子がちょっと大人びて見えたな。", "zh": "大人的味道啊。确实，之前那套抹茶冰淇淋风格的服装，\n让百合子看起来稍微成熟了些呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0222_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "abf0e7a95f355747e7ef0d3c9485e4509787d01c0325772bf0308e8fe78ee4c3", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？　{$P$}さんに\n言われると、なんだか照れますね……えへへ。", "zh": "诶，真的吗？被{$P$}先生这么一说，总觉得有点害羞呢……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0222_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0222_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "05cec66b1e65884ee0c04a74abc9c85abcb9441c1ff1286d28e925cf550c7ec9", "ja": "私、どんな大人になるのかなぁ……。\nふふっ、ちょっと楽しみです！", "zh": "我不知道自己会成为什么样的大人呢……。呵呵，有点期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
